// @vesper/ebpf: Vesper port of vesper-ebpf (port wave P3a lane 6, #1041).
// Part 1: the instruction codec (src/insn.rs), the wire structs
// (src/wire.rs), the tnum and interval domain (src/scalar.rs) with the
// verifier's domain functions, the concrete ALU semantics of
// src/interp.rs, the helper tables (src/helpers.rs), the map and program
// kinds of src/program.rs and the stack bound (src/callgraph.rs). Part 2:
// the verifier (src/verifier.rs, verifier.ves). Part 3: the BTF reader
// (src/btf.rs, btf.ves), the CO-RE matcher (src/core.rs, core.ves) and
// the .BTF.ext readers (src/btf_ext.rs, btf_ext.ves). The Rust files are the
// model; the Rust wrappers (src/port.rs) convert registers, error fields,
// MAC arrays and the verifier's input and outcome words.
//
// Every export is named `<module>_<rust fn>`.
